  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6204.02 Reciprocity Examination Fees",
  "priorExpiration": "2002-03-04",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6204.02 Reciprocity Examination Fees.\n\n(a) Students seeking certification based upon training taken in other jurisdictions shall be charged:\n\n(1) A $100.00 fee for Firefighter I certification, including all components;\n\n(2) A $80.00 fee for Firefighter II certification;\n\n(3) A $60.00 fee for all other certifications; and\n\n(4) A $400.00 fee for emergency service personnel from another state or non-emergency service personnel seeking New Hampshire certification, requiring research.\n\nSource. #7552, INTERIM, eff 9-5-01, EXPIRED: 3-4-02\n\nNew. #7747, eff 8-17-02; ss by #9496, eff 6-26-09; ss by #12477, eff 2-8-18 (formerly Saf-C 6203.02)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6200.html"
